Every file in commands/ and agents/ is a modified copy. Each file starts with a
comment that names its exact upstream path at the commit above and lists what
was changed. Changes are limited to paths and commands that would break outside
the HumanLayer repo: `humanlayer thoughts sync` made optional, HumanLayer-only
directories and helper agents replaced with generic wording, the upstream
developer's personal thoughts/ folder replaced with <user>, two `_generic`
command variants renamed, and a PR-template fallback in describe_pr.
